Architectural Overview
Scaling the CMB-0926 research instrument to a distributed cluster environment transforms the closed-loop active learning cycle into an industrial-grade compute pipeline. By embedding hardware metrics directly into the forensic telemetry schema, the system records not only the physical stability of the hydro-gravitational manifold, but also the computational performance profile across heterogeneous GPU nodes (NVIDIA Hopper/Blackwell, AMD MI300).
